Bluetooth: hci_bcm: match the iPad Air 2 (J81) BCM4350C2

Match apple,j81-bcm4350c2-bt (Orchard's compatible, binding in 0111) with
no board data: the mainline sequence at 115,200 is the one verified on
hardware (research/2026-11-02-bt-uart3-pinmux-lead.md). Orchard's own
match uses the iPad 5/7 board sequence, not yet validated on the Air 2.

diff -ruN a/drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c b/drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c
--- a/drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c	2026-11-02 17:16:06
+++ b/drivers/bluetooth/hci_bcm.c	2026-11-02 17:16:06
@@ -1592,6 +1592,11 @@
 	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm43438-bt", .data = &bcm43438_device_data },
 	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm4349-bt", .data = &bcm43438_device_data },
 	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm43540-bt", .data = &bcm4354_device_data },
+	/*
+	 * iPad Air 2: the plain sequence (115,200 baud, patchram, no early
+	 * baud change) is the one verified on hardware.
+	 */
+	{ .compatible = "apple,j81-bcm4350c2-bt" },
 	{ .compatible = "brcm,bcm4335a0" },
 	{ .compatible = "cypress,cyw4373a0-bt", .data = &cyw4373a0_device_data },
 	{ .compatible = "infineon,cyw55572-bt", .data = &cyw55572_device_data },
